WEBVTT

NOTE
This is the Dollet beach evacuation and escape sequence.
SeeD candidates flee the X-ATM092 and board their landing craft for extraction.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 14 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
The SeeD candidates race back down to the Dollet beach where their armored landing craft wait in the shallow waters. The vessels are positioned for rapid extraction, their metal forms gleaming in the fading sunset light. The orange-red sky bathes the entire scene in dramatic warm lighting. The beach's golden sand stretches between the fleeing soldiers and safety. The sound of the X-ATM092's mechanical footsteps grows louder as it pursues them toward the water.

00:10.000 --> 00:20.000
The mechanical spider emerges from the town and onto the open beach, its massive form silhouetted against the sunset. Its four legs crash through the sand, sending up clouds of dust and beach material. The red eyes glow intensely as it charges toward the fleeing SeeD candidates and their extraction vessels. The robot's speed across the open beach is terrifying, covering ground despite its enormous size. Soldiers scramble to board the waiting boats.

00:20.000 --> 00:30.000
Quistis Trepe is positioned on one of the landing craft, manning a mounted heavy machine gun. She swivels the weapon to face the advancing X-ATM092. Her expression is determined and focused as she acquires her target. The massive gun's barrel points directly at the mechanical spider. Other SeeD candidates on the beach continue their desperate flight toward the boats. The evacuation is under fire and under time pressure.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Quistis opens fire with the machine gun, unleashing a barrage of heavy ammunition toward the X-ATM092. The gun's muzzle flashes light up the beach with each shot. Tracer rounds streak across the sand toward the mechanical target. The bullets impact the robot's metal carapace and legs, creating sparks and impact marks. The sheer volume of fire from the mounted weapon is impressive, a devastating volume of lead directed at the pursuing machine.

00:40.000 --> 00:50.000
The X-ATM092 is hit repeatedly by Quistis's machine gun fire. The heavy impacts cause visible damage to the robot's metal body. Sections of its armor spark and dent from the projectile impacts. One of the robot's legs shows visible damage from the concentrated fire. The gunfire buys critical seconds for the remaining SeeD candidates to board the evacuation vessels. Squall and Zell splash through the shallow water toward the open ramps of the boats.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
The X-ATM092, damaged and slowed by the gunfire, continues its advance but with less mobility. One of its legs moves with jerky, damaged motions. Quistis continues her barrage, maintaining suppressing fire to keep the robot at bay. The SeeD candidates surge up the metal ramps into the landing craft. Soldiers help pull wounded or exhausted comrades aboard. The boats' engines begin to rev in preparation for departure.

01:00.000 --> 01:08.000
The damaged X-ATM092 stumbles forward on its injured legs, its mechanical body unable to maintain its previous relentless pace. Its red eyes still glow, but its pursuit has been halted by the combined firepower and damage it has sustained. One leg collapses beneath it, and the massive robot crashes to the sand with a thunderous impact. A cloud of dust explodes around its falling form.

01:08.000 --> 01:14.000
The SeeD landing vessels pull away from the Dollet shore, their engines roaring with power. The boats accelerate across the water, cutting through the shallows toward the open ocean. The X-ATM092 lies motionless on the beach behind them, its form shrinking as the extraction vessels speed away. The burning town of Dollet fades into the distance, illuminated by fires and destruction. The sunset reflects off the water as the boats leave the battle zone. The scene captures the successful but costly evacuation from the Field Exam mission.
